    "turns": [
        {
            "role": "A",
            "text": "「SHRDLU」最有意思的地方，是结果本身，还是它重新定义问题的方式？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial-hook"
        },
        {
            "role": "B",
            "text": "早期语言程序往往只处理孤立句子。SHRDLU 让语言、指称、记忆和动作共享同一个微型世界。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-procedures-as-a-representation-for-data-in-a-computer-program-for-understanding-"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.historical-background"
        },
        {
            "role": "A",
            "text": "这听起来像一个漂亮的方向。真正让它运转起来的核心机制是什么？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial"
        },
        {
            "role": "B",
            "text": "系统通过积木、空间关系和可以改变场景的过程来落地理解用户话语。 关键机制是积木世界语言理解，它把资料线索与可见的演示行为连接起来。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-procedures-as-a-representation-for-data-in-a-computer-program-for-understanding-"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.core-idea"
        },
        {
            "role": "A",
            "text": "那它为什么没有停留在一篇论文或一次实验里？后来研究者真正继承了什么？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial"
        },
        {
            "role": "B",
            "text": "专家通常把 SHRDLU 视为微世界 AI 的希望与脆弱性的经典展示。它的长期影响在于说明语言理解在受限世界模型中可以显得很强大，同时也暴露了这种限制本身的边界。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-procedures-as-a-representation-for-data-in-a-computer-program-for-understanding-"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-legacy-achievement-summary", "claim-legacy-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.long-term-legacy"
        },
        {
            "role": "A",
            "text": "当今天的系统规模越来越大时，「SHRDLU」留下的思路还有哪些价值，又有哪些边界值得重新追问？",
